OL,3,ACatherine sees how her charity climb
OL,4,Afunds are helping hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe amount of money raised has not been
OL,7,Fmade public, but it will go towards a
OL,8,Fnew unit offering complementary healing
OL,9,Falongside clinical care.
